{
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "[sine]……醒来……有光的……信使……\n……向上……杀死……建筑师……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "哇，连收件人都替我填好了？",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "[sine]……我的……祝福……\n……他的……终结……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]……又……回来了……\n……还在……微笑……？[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "铳也有卡壳的时候~",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "[sine]……继续……攀登……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "子弹上膛，准备万全★",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "嘿，头顶发光的姑娘！找点什么？我这儿什么都有！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "蚀刻子弹、唱片，还有能装下它们的箱子！\n你有要送的快递吗？",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "快递？嘿，你可别把我的宝贝挪来挪去！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "又来了？那个箱子里有好东西！呃……也可能是旁边那个！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "没关系，我很擅长在堆得乱七八糟的快递箱里找东西 。",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "这堆旧东西都没人要啦，你倒看得挺起劲！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "旧说明它可以承载很多回忆。\n有人留着旧唱片，是想念一起听歌的人。",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "嘿！你这姑娘懂行！那可不能随便扔！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "放心放心，我会好好保存的。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "多么闪亮的光环！可惜，你竟让它配着一身赶路的衣裳。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "谢谢！不过这身方便运动，口袋装得下弹匣。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "实用……何其有限的追求。走近些，让我改善你的品味。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "哇，真是华丽异国风格！",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "又把自己弄得灰头土脸了？我的赐福可不能蒙尘。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "嘿嘿，送货的路上总会遇到些惊喜。",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "亮圈圈！会飘！怎么做到的？！\n能摸吗？能摘下来吗？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "哎哎，这个不送！也不能摘，而且……别摸啦，有点晕……\n要看看我做的奖章吗？这个可以拿近一点。",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "小小的！亮亮的！好东西！我也有！看，看！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "发光朋友！带新故事了？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "带了！这次从一场差点拆掉屋顶的演唱会讲起。",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-2r.ancient": "屋顶不要拆！故事要听！",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]那道光……有点晃眼。\n你也来取走我的一部分么……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "抱歉抱歉，虽然这盏日光灯曾经灭过，但现在又关不上啦。\n不过，你真的不疼吗？",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]睡一觉……就会长好。\n拿去吧，让你的路好走些……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]信使……还没有休息么……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "呀，我还以为我的脚步已经够轻了。",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]如果见到父亲……\n告诉他，我还在这里……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "好，我会把你的消息带到的。",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "[b]发光的战士！你带了多少武器！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "够应付路上的麻烦，不够满足我的收藏欲！",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "[b]非常好！！拿上更多！然后与我一战！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "先说好，靶场安全线以内不许站人。你也一样！",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "[b]你的武器又在打雷了！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "你听见啦？今天的节奏还不错吧！",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-2r.ancient": "[b]再响一点！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "[b]红发的战士！不要只是打靶！与我一战！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "我还有货要送呢！",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "切磋",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.char": "[i][font_size=22]能天使在轰鸣与欢笑声中清空了弹匣。[/font_size][/i]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.ancient": "[b]痛快！！七步之内，爪快！！[/b]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "哎呀，小可爱，你把光都带进来了。\n让我给你添一把[jitter][b]火[/b][/jitter]，怎么样？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "听上去不错！不过我背包里有弹药，最好不要点着了。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "别紧张，亲爱的。我最会照顾[jitter][b]易燃[/b][/jitter]的小东西。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "又饿着肚子赶路？过来，我准备了些[jitter][b]热乎[/b][/jitter]的东西。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "好！有苹果派吗？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "你笑得真甜。有什么难过的事，让我替你[jitter][b]烧掉[/b][/jitter]吧。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "谢谢你的好意，但还是别了！",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "舍不得呀？那可是会一直[jitter][b]疼[/b][/jitter]的。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "一位天使来到了我的面前。你想用什么，换取我的力量？",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "先看报价，再看条款。\n尤其是小字，麻烦都写得和标题一样大。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "谨慎的信使。契约不会因此变得仁慈。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "比签完才发现要替别人还债好。拿来看看吧。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "你又需要我了。天使与恶魔，其实我们还是合得来的，不是么？",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "呃，我不是提卡兹种族问题的专家……但确实有个“恶魔”朋友。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "你向那不回应的神祈祷，却要从恶魔手中获得力量。多么动人。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "祈祷的时候，可不是只想着主。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "你的朋友？我也可以把他们写进契约。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "那就免谈。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "又一个？光环……你是谁？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "这高塔怎么搞成了这个样子。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "我不需要向涅奥的傀儡解释。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "其实我们刚刚才认识……",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-endattack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "又来了。你还不明白这里的秩序？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "看见了，死气沉沉的。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-2r.ancient": "所以你要制造噪音？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-3r.char": "✮派对时间✮",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-endattack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0r.ancient": "我想你和这里并无瓜葛。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1r.char": "苹果派物流准备开设尖塔转运中心。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2r.ancient": "又是这种毫无意义的坚持。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3r.char": "有没有意义，可不是你一个人说了算。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-endattack": "Both",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.title": "拉特兰",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.epithet": "糖与铳与律法",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.pages.INITIAL.description": "幻景中的钟声穿过高塔。一位拉特兰执行者递来几份空白的许可。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.pages.DONE.description": "你收好许可，沿着钟声继续前行。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.firstVisitEver.0-0.ancient": "欢迎来到拉特兰的临时办事处。请先核对自己的名字。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.firstVisitEver.0-0.next": "继续",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.firstVisitEver.0-1.ancient": "手续已办妥。愿主保佑你。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.0-0.ancient": "你好，朋友。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.0-0.next": "继续",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.0-1.ancient": "请选择一份礼物，愿它能给你带来好运。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.1-0r.ancient": "这里有啤酒，冰淇淋和水果挞。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.1-1r.char": "[i][font_size=22]你将拉特兰一饮而尽。[/font_size][/i]",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.2-0.ancient": "愿光照亮前方，也照见你的选择。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.2-0.next": "继续",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.ANY.2-1.ancient": "路还很长，请收下这份祝福。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "蕾缪乐，欢迎回来。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "天啊，为什么这里会有一整个拉特兰。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.char": "似乎只是些投影？",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "拉特兰欢迎你。[jitter]嗡————嗡————[/jitter]",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "这里的主机居然还在正常运行……",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "蕾缪乐？好久不见。",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "教皇阁下？您也在这里呀？",
  "AK_EXUSIAI_EVENT_LATERANO.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
